#: src/pages/Privacy.tsx
msgid "privacy.analytics.body"
msgstr "This site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics (provided and stored by Cloudflare) only to learn how many people use it, which pages are opened and how fast they load. It uses no cookies and collects no names, emails or anything that identifies a person. It collects the page path (path only, no query string), the referring site, browser and operating system type, country or region, and page load performance metrics. It never includes your answers, progress or error records, and it is enabled only on the production site {0}. Nothing is sent while offline, and a failed load does not affect learning."

